{"id":"02523cf5c9863d04","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-lemma.md","title":"Solovay Lemma","display":"lem-solovay-lemma — Solovay Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-lemma","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-lemma"],"display":"lem-solovay-lemma — Solovay Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-lemma — Solovay Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97b68cd750e79cac\" href=\"?note=97b68cd750e79cac\" title=\"89-df-solovay-realization\">89-df-solovay-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab8391d7623da45d\" href=\"?note=ab8391d7623da45d\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical\">89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\tau_{\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is a Solovay realization,\nand <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the PA-provable-sentence set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 GL 算术可靠性对 Solovay 特殊实现的实例；该方向只使用实现是\nPA 的标准可证明性实现，不使用反模型构造的特殊忠实性引理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Boolos 第 3 章 pp.51–62。将 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab8391d7623da45d\" href=\"?note=ab8391d7623da45d\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical\">89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</a> 中的全称实现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 实例化为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\sigma\">\\(\\tau_\\sigma\\)</span>，直接得到 Assertion；这里只使用标准 PA 实现，不需要 Solovay 极限句的特殊性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-solovay-realization","status":"resolved","id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical","status":"resolved","id":"ab8391d7623da45d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical","status":"resolved","id":"ab8391d7623da45d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos 第 3 章 pp.51–62。将 [[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]] 中的全称实现 $\\tau$ 实例化为给定 $\\tau_\\sigma$，直接得到 Assertion；这里只使用标准 PA 实现，不需要 Solovay 极限句的特殊性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\sigma}\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1262,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"证明有限推导结论集与交集 GL 相同，补齐定理集/判定接口；为 Solovay 特殊实现的可靠性实例补上真实上游。见 [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]、[[89-lem-solovay-lemma]]。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-436","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["97b68cd750e79cac","1f581262c09d5e34","0006800fa1c85177","86ad48bbd1843ed6","8f382173effd5662","ab8391d7623da45d"]}